From 67ae3405e23ff64b6a605abd71d5184cd53be3a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:32:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(widget): simplify the header ribbon to a single
 theme.banner string

Review feedback: the config should be just { theme: { banner?: "Chat and
earn coins" } }, with every colour derived from the accent colour, so it is
easy to set from the backend. Removes dismissable, icon, iconUrl,
background, textColor and id, and the "dismissed" memory with them.
Renames ribbon to banner. The embed maps theme.banner (a string) from the
agent config.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ARKEhk1KiGHfWe6vuE6FJL
